  "description_short": "Family-friendly steakhouse in Langeberg Mall serving flame-grilled beef, seafood, and South African classics.",
  "description_long": "Tucked into Langeberg Mall, Cattle Baron Mossel Bay brings reliable flame-grilled steaks and hearty South African comfort food to Die Voor Bay. The menu covers all the bases—ribeyes, rump, and fillet cuts alongside seafood platters, burgers, and ribs. It's the kind of place where families gather for Sunday lunch and groups settle in for a satisfying meal without fuss.\n\nThe atmosphere is relaxed and unpretentious, with generous portions that won't break the bank. Steaks are cooked over an open flame, and sides like pap, creamed spinach, and crispy onion rings round out the plates. The seafood selection includes prawns, calamari, and line fish when available. Service is friendly, and the setting works well for both quick mall visits and longer sit-down meals.\n\nLocated off Louis Fourie Road, it's an easy stop whether you're shopping, passing through Mossel Bay, or looking for a dependable meal with the family. The restaurant handles groups comfortably and offers a straightforward menu that delivers what it promises.",
